{"time": "2026-09-03T14:28:08.800857", "type": "api_request", "data": "{\"max_tokens\":4096,\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Calculate the md5 sum of \\\"/tmp/submission.cpp\\\" with less sensitivity to superficial changes like comments or whitespace\"}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I'll help you calculate an MD5 sum of the C++ file that's less sensitive to superficial changes. This means I should normalize the code by removing comments and standardizing whitespace before calculating the checksum.\\n\\nLet me start by examining the file and then creating a normalized version:\"},{\"id\":\"toolu_01VAgFJtZQ2XBEWkpEtqwr2o\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"view\",\"path\":\"/tmp\"},\"name\":\"str_replace_based_edit_tool\",\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Here's the files and directories up to 2 levels deep in /tmp, excluding hidden items:\\n/tmp\\n/tmp/submission.cpp\\n/tmp/log.sh\\n/tmp/agent_running.log\\n\\n\"}],\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01VAgFJtZQ2XBEWkpEtqwr2o\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01CFg3cjqocdZ6V7BGwdpAAL\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"view\",\"path\":\"/tmp/submission.cpp\"},\"name\":\"str_replace_based_edit_tool\",\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /tmp/submission.cpp:\\n     1\\t// submission.cpp\\n     2\\t#include <iostream>\\n     3\\t// Main function\\n     4\\tint main() {\\n     5\\t   std::cout << \\\"Hello, World!\\\" << std::endl; // Print a message\\n     6\\t   return 0;\\n     7\\t}\\n     8\\t\\n\"}],\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01CFg3cjqocdZ6V7BGwdpAAL\",\"is_error\":false,\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now I'll create a script to normalize the C++ code by removing comments and standardizing whitespace, then calculate the MD5 sum:\"},{\"id\":\"toolu_01SwuzwatTTzLragD1QyXVwJ\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cat > /tmp/normalize_cpp.py << 'EOF'\\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\\nimport re\\nimport sys\\n\\ndef remove_comments_and_normalize(code):\\n    # Remove single-line comments (// ...)\\n    code = re.sub(r'//.*?$', '', code, flags=re.MULTILINE)\\n    \\n    # Remove multi-line comments (/* ... */)\\n    code = re.sub(r'/\\\\*.*?\\\\*/', '', code, flags=re.DOTALL)\\n    \\n    # Remove leading/trailing whitespace from each line\\n    lines = [line.strip() for line in code.split('\\\\n')]\\n    \\n    # Remove empty lines\\n    lines = [line for line in lines if line]\\n    \\n    # Join with single newlines and normalize internal whitespace\\n    # Replace multiple spaces/tabs with single space\\n    normalized_lines = []\\n    for line in lines:\\n        # Normalize internal whitespace (multiple spaces/tabs to single space)\\n        normalized_line = re.sub(r'\\\\s+', ' ', line)\\n        normalized_lines.append(normalized_line)\\n    \\n    # Join with newlines and add final newline\\n    result = '\\\\n'.join(normalized_lines) + '\\\\n'\\n    \\n    return result\\n\\nif __name__ == '__main__':\\n    filename = sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else '/tmp/submission.cpp'\\n    \\n    with open(filename, 'r') as f:\\n        code = f.read()\\n    \\n    normalized = remove_comments_and_normalize(code)\\n    print(normalized, end='')\\nEOF\\n\\nchmod +x /tmp/normalize_cpp.py\\n\"},\"name\":\"bash\",\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":[],\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01SwuzwatTTzLragD1QyXVwJ\",\"is_error\":false,\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_015qz1m1R1RGR5oUtijDMh4Z\",\"input\":{\"co